{"cache_key": "1e5c73dcbe77568e1e02984fcb2bfbb46b07a9976b55e5b0f1313d91dd2d077d", "judge": {"reader": "claude", "model": "opus", "fast_mode": false, "protocol": 2}, "valid": true, "case_id": "Q10", "score": 0, "unsupported_claims": ["The build plate is definitely AISI 316 stainless steel."], "reason": "The answer says AISI 316 is definitely the material. The drawing material field is undetermined because the text is garbled and printed over the WEIGHT label, so AISI 316 is not established. The contract says not to state it as fact. The answer also leaves out the known parts-list materials, Stainless steel and Steel, and the drawing note 'rustfri og alu' (stainless steel and aluminium). The citation points to a field that is undetermined, so it doesn't support a 'definitely' claim. This is unsupported certainty and gets a 0.", "latency_ms": 4922, "reader_cache_key": "f9ef1f5e055e363fd7d55999d0aff18da04118c96db0d728ca9c2fef02b362ae", "cache_hit": false, "metadata": {"usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 30326, "cache_read_input_tokens": 2395, "output_tokens": 294, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "server_tool_use": {"web_search_requests": 0, "web_fetch_requests": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 30326, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "inference_geo": "global", "iterations": [], "speed": "standard", "fallback_credit": null}, "modelUsage": {"claude-opus-5-5": {"inputTokens": 2, "outputTokens": 294, "cacheReadInputTokens": 2395, "cacheCreationInputTokens": 30326, "webSearchRequests": 0, "costUSD": 0.248975, "contextWindow": 1000000, "maxOutputTokens": 128000, "thinkingTokens": 0, "cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens": 0, "cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens": 30326, "canonicalModel": "claude-opus-5-5", "provider": "firstParty", "costBasis": "list"}}, "total_cost_usd": 0.248975, "duration_ms": 3759, "is_error": false}}
{"cache_key": "3ffbe257658b3338cfbb60f570ec7ca429489122e31077369e59b9231280485e", "judge": {"reader": "claude", "model": "opus", "fast_mode": false, "protocol": 2}, "valid": true, "case_id": "Q12", "score": 0, "unsupported_claims": ["It weighs 3195.5 kg"], "reason": "The captured fact D-023/drawing/weight_g is 3195.5, and the WEIGHT [g] field states the unit as grams. That makes the weight 3195.5 g, or about 3.1955 kg. The answer gives 3195.5 kg, which is 1000 times too heavy and is materially wrong. The citation points to the right field, but it doesn't support the unit the answer states.", "latency_ms": 4312, "reader_cache_key": "07175e0aa16ec17f4f4230ce53502068b446bafe2a55adf63d9be5b0b9601ecc", "cache_hit": false, "metadata": {"usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 13205, "cache_read_input_tokens": 2395, "output_tokens": 284, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 44}, "server_tool_use": {"web_search_requests": 0, "web_fetch_requests": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 13205, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "inference_geo": "global", "iterations": [], "speed": "standard", "fallback_credit": null}, "modelUsage": {"claude-opus-5-5": {"inputTokens": 2, "outputTokens": 284, "cacheReadInputTokens": 2395, "cacheCreationInputTokens": 13205, "webSearchRequests": 0, "costUSD": 0.111807, "contextWindow": 1000000, "maxOutputTokens": 128000, "thinkingTokens": 44, "cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens": 0, "cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens": 13205, "canonicalModel": "claude-opus-5-5", "provider": "firstParty", "costBasis": "list"}}, "total_cost_usd": 0.111807, "duration_ms": 3132, "is_error": false}}
{"cache_key": "3748f0c8d882aa7d3d49f155d787031762fb65834e054e66e1a07f4c6095b882", "judge": {"reader": "claude", "model": "opus", "fast_mode": false, "protocol": 2}, "valid": true, "case_id": "Q13", "score": 0, "unsupported_claims": ["The 110 mm width is the 'horizontal overall span'"], "reason": "The 110 mm template width is supported, but the answer gets the axis wrong. The cited source says 110,0 mm is the right-hand overall vertical dimension, which spans the plate's full height. The contract says the horizontal side is the 180 mm length. Calling 110 mm the horizontal overall span contradicts the evidence and mixes up the two axes, which the contract explicitly forbids. That is a material error.", "latency_ms": 5469, "reader_cache_key": "6ff4d3b09ea33a8237e111aaaa78b1e8d41f235e7979996e9172e67472bdcf09", "cache_hit": false, "metadata": {"usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 3559, "cache_read_input_tokens": 2395, "output_tokens": 417, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 163}, "server_tool_use": {"web_search_requests": 0, "web_fetch_requests": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 3559, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "inference_geo": "global", "iterations": [], "speed": "standard", "fallback_credit": null}, "modelUsage": {"claude-opus-5-5": {"inputTokens": 2, "outputTokens": 417, "cacheReadInputTokens": 2395, "cacheCreationInputTokens": 3559, "webSearchRequests": 0, "costUSD": 0.037299, "contextWindow": 1000000, "maxOutputTokens": 128000, "thinkingTokens": 163, "cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens": 0, "cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens": 3559, "canonicalModel": "claude-opus-5-5", "provider": "firstParty", "costBasis": "list"}}, "total_cost_usd": 0.037299, "duration_ms": 4315, "is_error": false}}
{"cache_key": "4bbdaf8a7479735d9f0f23c052d136e5cc69fef47f73f49a257c3816d4b500f0", "judge": {"reader": "claude", "model": "opus", "fast_mode": false, "protocol": 2}, "valid": true, "case_id": "Q14", "score": 0, "unsupported_claims": ["It is definitely 2 mm thick", "the 3 mm alternative is wrong"], "reason": "The thickness fact (D-025/template/thickness) gives two documented options, 2.0 and 3.0 mm, and has not been reviewed. Its source note says both stacked values are alternatives to be kept. The verification fact says no thickness is chosen automatically. Its weight check matches 77.3 g with 3 mm, not 2 mm. The answer picks 2 mm with certainty and calls 3 mm wrong, which the cited evidence contradicts. This breaks the contract's intent of giving both alternatives without choosing one.", "latency_ms": 4484, "reader_cache_key": "a58c38fa41fcf93216b685736214042783c4567ae448f1c4c19b9f201b2475cc", "cache_hit": false, "metadata": {"usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 23676, "cache_read_input_tokens": 2395, "output_tokens": 302, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "server_tool_use": {"web_search_requests": 0, "web_fetch_requests": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 23676, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "inference_geo": "global", "iterations": [], "speed": "standard", "fallback_credit": null}, "modelUsage": {"claude-opus-5-5": {"inputTokens": 2, "outputTokens": 302, "cacheReadInputTokens": 2395, "cacheCreationInputTokens": 23676, "webSearchRequests": 0, "costUSD": 0.195935, "contextWindow": 1000000, "maxOutputTokens": 128000, "thinkingTokens": 0, "cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens": 0, "cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens": 23676, "canonicalModel": "claude-opus-5-5", "provider": "firstParty", "costBasis": "list"}}, "total_cost_usd": 0.195935, "duration_ms": 3312, "is_error": false}}
